  "description": "Seo-Jin has been in love with his best friend, Jei, for 15 years. So when Jei announces his engagement, Seo-Jin can’t hide his feelings any longer and flees to Korea. But Jei, determined to understand why Seo-Jin left, follows him. Now living together in the same apartment, Seo-Jin’s emotions spiral. He wants to move on, but being so close to Jei makes it harder than ever to let go.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
